     "text": "The execution of a program to find its errors is called testing. Here, the bugs are identified in the programmed modules. The purpose of testing is to evaluate an attribute or capability of a program or system and determine that whether it meets its required results. Testing/verification the software is actually operating the software under controlled conditions. It is the process of checking the items for consistency by evaluating the results against pre-specified requirements.",
