   "theoryPashto": "۵.۱.۶ د لړۍ تېرېدل\n\nد لړۍ عناصرو ته لاسرسی د لړۍ تېرېدل (traversing) بلل کېږي.\n\n// reading numbers into an array and then searching for an item\n#include <iostream.h>\n#include <conio.h>\nint main()\n{\nint a[10]; // Declare an array of 10 integers\nint n = 0;\ncout<< \"Enter 10 integer values\"<<endl;\nwhile (n<10)\n{\ncin >> a[n];\nn++;\n}\nint item; // declare an item to search\ncout<< \"Enter an item to search\"<<endl;\ncin>>item;\nfor (int i=0; i<10; i++) //traverse array\n{\nif(item!=a[i]) // comparison\ncontinue;\nelse\n{\ncout<< \"Item \"<<item<<\" is found at location \"<<i+1;\ngoto end;\n}\n}\ncout << \"Search unsuccessful: \"<<item<< \" is not found\";\nend:\ngetch();\nreturn 0;\n}\n\nد for حلقې په مرسته د لړۍ د تېرېدو بل پروګرام ته پام وکړئ چې د لړۍ طاق ارزښتونه ښيي.\n\n#include <iostream.h>\n#include <conio.h>\nint main()\n{\nint A [] = {3, 2, 7, 5, 8};\nfor ( int i=0 ; i<5 ; i++ )\n{\nif (A[i] % 2 !=0)\ncout<< A[i] << endl;\n}\ngetch();\nreturn 0;\n}\n\nد پروګرام وتنه\n\n3\n7\n5",
   "content": "<p>5.1.6 Traversing an array</p><p>Accessing the elements of an array is called traversing of array.</p><p>// reading numbers into an array and then searching for an item\n#include &lt;iostream.h&gt;\n#include &lt;conio.h&gt;\nint main()\n{\nint a[10]; // Declare an array of 10 integers\nint n = 0;\ncout&lt;&lt; &quot;Enter 10 integer values&quot;&lt;&lt;endl;\nwhile (n&lt;10)\n{\ncin &gt;&gt; a[n];\nn++;\n}\nint item; // declare an item to search\ncout&lt;&lt; &quot;Enter an item to search&quot;&lt;&lt;endl;\ncin&gt;&gt;item;\nfor (int i=0; i&lt;10; i++) //traverse array\n{\nif(item!=a[i]) // comparison\ncontinue;\nelse\n{\ncout&lt;&lt; &quot;Item &quot;&lt;&lt;item&lt;&lt;&quot; is found at location &quot;&lt;&lt;i+1;\ngoto end;\n}\n}\ncout &lt;&lt; &quot;Search unsuccessful: &quot;&lt;&lt;item&lt;&lt; &quot; is not found&quot;;\nend:\ngetch();\nreturn 0;\n}</p><p>Consider another program of array traversal using for loop to display those values from the array which are odd.</p><p>#include &lt;iostream.h&gt;\n#include &lt;conio.h&gt;\nint main()\n{\nint A [] = {3, 2, 7, 5, 8};\nfor ( int i=0 ; i&lt;5 ; i++ )\n{\nif (A[i] % 2 !=0)\ncout&lt;&lt; A[i] &lt;&lt; endl;\n}\ngetch();\nreturn 0;\n}</p><p>Output of the program</p><p>3\n7\n5</p>",
