     "text": "// passing integer constant as argument.\n#include<iostream.h>\n#include<conio.h>\nvoid display(int x)\n{\ncout << \" x= \" << x << endl;\n}.\nint main()\n{\ndisplay(25); // function call\ngetch();\nreturn 0;\n}",
